(500576,'$?a803031[|cffffffff][|cffff3232]Requires Soul Infusion|r\r\nSummons 1 |cffffffffSpectral Scythe|r for each |CffffffffReaped Soul|r active, which attack a nearby enemy for $d.$?s301986[ For the duration, damage dealt by |cffffffffSoul Strike|r is increased by $301986s1%.][]\r\n\r\nStriking enemies with |cffffffffSoul Strike|r causes the |cFFFFFFFFSpectral Scythe|r to attack that enemy and 5 nearby enemies. Damage dealt this way redirects the threat to you.\r\n\r\nConsumes |cff5ee2ffReaped Souls|r and |cff5ee2ffSoul Infusion|r.'),
